g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/378052039","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/6931#issuecomment-378052039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/6931","id":378052039,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3ODA1MjAzOQ==","user":{"login":"robrichard","id":3814096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTQwOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3814096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard","html_url":"https://github.com/robrichard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-02T21:27:14Z","updated_at":"2018-04-02T21:27:14Z","body":"I have not been able to create a minimum reproducible test repo yet as I have not yet figured out what specifically in my compilation is triggering this issue. I have debugged enough to understand the basic reason for this problem.\r\n\r\n#### EntryPoint\r\n* `pdp-mobile`\r\n* * does not contain `chunkId 1`\r\n* `sb-mobile`\r\n* * contains `chunkId 1`\r\n\r\n#### ChunkGroups\r\n* `MultiRequestModal`\r\n* * contains `chunkId 1`\r\n\r\nWhen the `MultiRequestModal` async chunk is loaded on the `pdp-mobile` page, webpack attempts to load `chunkId 1` because it is a requirement of that chunk and not already loaded. However, the runtime `chunkMap` does not contain `chunkId 1` because it is excluded by `Chunk#getAllAsyncChunks` when it is generated (because it is part of the sb-mobile EntryPoint). \r\n\r\nIs it normal for a chunk to be a dependency of both an entry point and an async chunk?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/378052039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"robrichard","id":3814096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTQwOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3814096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard","html_url":"https://github.com/robrichard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robrichard/received_events","type":"User","user_