hub.com/users/Legends/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-03T05:50:33Z","updated_at":"2018-04-04T10:59:17Z","body":"This looks like a bug to me.\r\n\r\nThe app  works fine in `--mode development`.\r\nIn `--mode production` it only works when `runtimeChunk` is set to:\r\n\r\n```\r\noptimization: {\r\n        runtimeChunk: \"multiple\" | true  // <-- \"single\" fails here!\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\noptimization: {\r\nruntimeChunk: {\r\n            name: `my-runtime`,  // <-- fails\r\n        },\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Chunk-Id is `0` and `0` is not a property of the object (blue).**\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/966368/38303904-c2d6662c-3807-11e8-9b55-71332a84298b.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nA core team member will take care of this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/378135893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Legends","id":966368,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NjM2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/966368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends","html_url":"https://github.com/Legends","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Legends/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Le